    <string name="privacy_body">Your games, times and statistics stay on this device, in storage only this app can read. There is no account, no cloud and no backend. The only part of the app that uses the internet is the advertising SDK (Huawei Petal Ads), which sends the advertising identifier (OAID), IP address, and device, network and app information in order to select an ad. Nothing you do inside a puzzle is ever sent anywhere.</string>
    <string name="ads_body">This game is free and has no subscription or in-app purchase. Ads pay for it. A banner appears on the home and statistics screens, and an ad may appear after a puzzle ends. No ad is ever shown on the board while you are playing.</string>
